====================================================================================================
(a) symbolic evaluation of eq. S6 with B&O's integrand (s^2 - 2tu)(s'^2 - 2t'u')/(s s')
====================================================================================================
Theta^2 from N = 2 helicities x int dk~ Theta^2  -> [2*pi**2*N/(omega*sigma)]  (B&O: 2 pi^2 N/(omega sigma))
int d alpha (t^2+u^2)/s = -pi*(K**2/2 - 2*omega**2)*(sin(theta)**2 + 2)
int dOmega_gamma [int d alpha (t^2+u^2)/s]^2 = 36*pi**3*(K - 2*omega)**2*(K + 2*omega)**2/5
dP/dt from eq. S6 = 3*G**2*N**2*omega**3*sigma**2/(25*pi)  ; coefficient of G^2 N^2 omega^3 sigma^2 = 3/(25*pi)  ; B&O eq. 8: 3/(25 pi)

====================================================================================================
